<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">Kolosa</book>
  <para style="h">Kolosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kolosa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolosa</para>
  <para style="mt">Kolosa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paula, Pathian duhzâwng anga Krista Isua Tirhkoh leh kan unaupa Timothea chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kolosa khuaa mi thianghlim awm Kristaa unau rinawmte chibai kan bûk e. Pathian kan Pa hnên ata khawngaihna leh remna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In tân kan ṭawngṭai apiangin Pathian, kan Lalpa Isua Krista Pa chu lâwmthu kan hrilh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Krista Isua in rin tâk thu te, mi thianghlim zawng zawng in hmangaih tâk thu te kan lo hria a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha thutak in hriat aṭanga beiseina in lo neih tâk vâng a ni a, chu beiseina chu in tân vânah dah ṭhat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In hnêna Chanchin Ṭha a lo thlena, Pathian khawngaihna chu in hriat chian ni aṭanga thil awm dân ang khân khawvêl ram tinah Chanchin Ṭha chuan rah chhuahin a darh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan tâna Krista rawngbâwltu rinawm Epafra, kan bawihpui duh tak, Chanchin Ṭha hrilhtu che u hian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thlarau zâra hmangaihna in neih thu hi min hrilh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan thlarau lam finna leh hriatthiamna tinrênga a duhzâwng in hriat famkim theih nân, in chanchin kan hriat ni aṭangin ṭawngṭai leh dîlsak che u kan bâng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa mi ni tlâka a lâwmzâwng in niha, hnathawh ṭha tinrênga rah chhuahin, engkima Pathian hriatnaa in ṭhan len theih nân kan dîl ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thiltihtheihna ropui tak aṭanga chhuak chakna chuan kawng tinrênga chhelna leh dawhtheihna nei tûrin a tichak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, mi thianghlimte nên a ram ênga rochan nei ve tlâka siamtu che u Pathian chu hlim takin lâwmthu in hrilh thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani chuan thim thuneihna laka min chhan chhuakin, a Fapa hmangaih taka ramah chuan min hruai lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Fapaah chuan tlan chhuah kan ni a, kan sualte ngaihdam a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Krista chu hmuh theih loh Pathian anpui, thil siam zawng zawng hmahruaitu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amahah chuan engkim, vâna awm te, leia awm te, hmuh theih te, hmuh theih loh te siam a ni a; lalṭhutthlêng te, rorêlna te, lalna te, thuneihna te, engkim hi amah avânga siam a ni a, ama ta tûra siam a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chu engkim awm hmain a awm a, amahah chuan engkim a innghat bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chu kohhran lu a ni a, kohhran hi a taksa a ni bawk; ani chu engkim bul a ni a, engkima chungnung ber a nih theih nân mitthi zîng ata thawhlehna hmahruaitu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amahah Pathian nihna famkim a awm hi Pa duhzâwng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Krista avângin engkim Amah nên a inremtîr leh a, krawsa a Fapa thisen chuan remna a siam a, Krista avâng chuan leia awmte leh vâna awmte chu Amah nêna inremna a siam ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangni pawh hmânah chuan Pathian lakah mikhual in ni a, thil sual in ngaihtuaha in tih ṭhin avângin hmêlma in ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tûnah zawng a Fapa, tisaa lo chang thihna avângin a hmaah thianghlim, hmêlhem lo leh sawisêlbova in awm theih nân Pathianin Amah nên a inremtîr ta che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, rinnaah awm reng ula, nghet taka dingin Chanchin Ṭha in hriat avânga beiseina in neih tâk kha tawlh bosan suh u. Chanchin Ṭha chu vân hnuaia thil siam tinrêng hnênah hrilh a ni ta, kei Paula hi chumi rawngbâwltu chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangmahni avânga ka tuarnaah tûnah hian ka lâwm a ni. A taksa, kohhran tâna Krista tuar bâkte chu ka tisain ka chhunzawm zêl a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian thu leh a remruat in hnêna kim taka puang tûrin Pathianin hna mi pe a, kohhran rawngbâwltuah kei hi mi siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng laka a lo thup kumkhua ṭhin thurûk kha, tûnah hian a mi thianghlimte hnênah a tilang ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chûng mite hnênah chuan hnam tin tâna a thurûk ropui leh hlu tak chu Pathianin hriattîr a duh rêng a ni; chu thurûk chu Krista, nangmahnia awm, ropuina beisei chhan chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Krista thu chu mi zawng zawng hnênah kan hril a, Kristaa kan puitlin ṭheuh theih nân finna tinrêngin mi tin kan zirtîrin kan kaihruai ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chumi ti tûr chuan Krista chakna, keimahnia thawk ṭhîn chu hmangin kan bei a, rim takin kan thawk a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangni leh Laodikei khuaa mi leh tisaa ka hmêl hmu lote pawhin, engti kauva rimin nge in tân ka thawh ṭhin in hriat ka duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An thinlung a thlamuan theih nân hmangaihnaa an insuih khâwma, kawng tinrênga thinlungah hriat chianna an ngaha, Pathian thurûk, Krista chu, an hriat theih ka duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kristaah chuan finna leh hriatthiamna ro hlu zawng zawng chu a inphûm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu man, thu dik ni âwm taka lang, dik si lova an bum mai loh nân che u hei hi ka sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tisain in hnênah awm lo mah ila, thlarau zawngin in zîngah ka awm a, in invawn felzia leh Krista rinnaa in nghehzia ka hmuhin ka lâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Krista Isua chu Lalpaa in pawm tâk avângin amahah awm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amahah chuan zung kaiin inrem chho ula, zirtîrna in dawn ang khân rinnaah chuan ding nghet ula, lâwmthu sawi uar rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Fîmkhur rawh u, Krista aṭanga chhuak ni lo, khawvêl zirtîrna ramhuai aṭanga chhuak, khawvêl finna an tih, mihring inzirtîr chhâwn mai mai hmangin tuten emaw an bum dah ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kristaah chuan Pathian famkimna tinrêng chu taksain a awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chu lalna leh thuneihna zawng zawng lu a ni a, amahah chuan nangni pawh tihfamkim in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amahah serh tan in ni ta, kuta tisa vun tan ni lovin, Kristaah chuan serh tan in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Baptisma-ah chuan a hnênah phûm ve in ni a, mitthi zînga ata amah kaithotu Pathian thiltihtheihna rin avângin amahah chuan kaihthawh in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In bawhchhiatnate leh tisaa serh tan loh in nih avângin thi in ni a; nimahsela, Krista nên a tinung ta che u a; kan bawhchhiatna zawng zawng min ngaidam ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />thupêk, kuta ziak, min dâl ṭhîntu, zawm kan bat si chu a thai chhia a, krawsah chuan khêngbetin a tibo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Krawsah chuan boruaka rorêltute leh thuneitute chu hnehin, chûngte chu mipui hmuhah chiang takin a tilang ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, ei leh in thu-ah emaw, kût hman thu-ah emaw, thla thar kût hman thu-ah emaw, sabat serh thu-ah emaw tu man thu neihsak che u suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng chu thil lo la awm tûr hlimthla mai a ni, a tak chu Krista hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Taksa ngaihnêp tûr, vântirhkohte pawh biak tûr tia, inlârna danglam bîk hmua insawi, tisa tak rilru pua, engmahlova inhâmpuarho hi in chungah thu neihtîr suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lû, Krista chu, an vuan tawh lo. Amahah chuan taksa pum hi tha leh ruangâma phuar khâwmin châwm a ni a, Pathian duhzâwng angin taksa pum chu a ṭhang ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khawvêl zirtîrna dik lote chu Kristaah in thihsan tawh si chuan, engtizia nge khawvêl mi la ni fo anga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />‘tawk suh, tem suh, dek suh,’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tia mihring thil an intuk chawp leh phuah chawp hnuaia in kûn leh tâk mai? Chûngte chu hman zawha ral mai thil a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hêng vântirhkoh biak tih te, taksa ngaih nêp tihte hi ṭha âwm takin a lang a; mahse, tisa châkna hneh tûrin a ṭangkai si lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Krista hnênah kaihthawh in ni ta a; chuvângin, Pathian ding lama Krista ṭhutnaa awm, chung lam thilte chu zawng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chung lam thilah in rilru nghat tlat ula, lei lam thilah chuan nghat suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In thi tawh a, in nunna chu Krista hnênah Pathianin a vawng ṭha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In nunna bul, Krista chu, a lo lan hunah nangni pawh a hnênah ropui takin in lang ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In khawvêl nun sual - inngaihna te, bawlhhlawhna te, hurna te, châkna sual te, duhâmna te (chu chu milem biakna a ni) hêngte hi tihlum rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng thil avâng chuan ring lote chungah Pathian thinur a lo thleng dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmânah chuan nangni pawh chutiang chuan in awm a, in duhzâwng ber a ni ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tûnah zawng thinrim te, thinchhiat te, inhuat te bânsan ula, insawichhiat te leh zahmawh sawi te in ka aṭangin chhuak suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dâwt inhrilh tawn chîng suh u, mihring hlui chu a thiltihte nên in hlîp tawh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mihring thar chuan in inthuam tawh si a; Pathian hre chiang tûrin chu mihring thar chu a siamtu anga awm tûra siam tharin a awm mêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu nun tharah chuan Grik leh Juda, serh tan leh tan loh, awzia leh hnam dang mi, bawih leh bawih lo a awm theih loh, Krista chauh hi engkim a ni a, engkimah a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pathian mi thlan, mi thianghlim leh duh takte ni âwm rêngin, thinlung taka inlainatna te, ngilneihna te, inngaihtlâwmna te, thuhnuairawlhna te, dawhtheihna te chuan inthuam rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Indawh tawn ula, mi dang laka thu pawi in neih pawhin inngaidam tawn rawh u, Lalpan a ngaidam che u ang bawk hian ngaidam ve rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chungah chuan hmangaihna inbel ula, chu chu engkim rem taka phuar khâwm theitu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kristaa chhuak remna chuan in thinlungah ro rêl rawh se, taksa pumkhata awm tûra koh in ni si a. Lâwm nachâng hre bawk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Krista thu chu, a hausakna zawng zawng nên nangmahniah chêng rawh se. Fakna hla te, Pathian hla te, Thlarau lam hla te nên finna tinrêngin inzirtîr ula, infuih tawn rawh u. In thinlung taka Pathian chawimawiin hlim takin zai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Krista zâra Pathian hnêna lâwmthu hril chungin in tih apiang, thu sawiah emaw, thiltihah emaw, Lalpa Isua hmingin ti vek rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nute u, in pasalte thu awih rawh u, chu chu Lalpa mite tih âwm rêng a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pate u, in nupuite khawngaih ula, an lakah sual suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Naupangte u, engkimah in nu leh pate thu zâwm rawh u, chu chu Lalpa lâwmzâwng a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pate u, in fate tithinur suh u, an beidawng dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawihte u, engkimah in pute thu zâwm ula, mihring tihlâwm tumtute anga an hmuh lai chauhva thawk lovin, thinlung taka Lalpa ṭih chungin an hmuh lohvah pawh thawk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />In tih apiangah mihring rawngbâwl ang ni lovin, Lalpa rawngbâwl ang zâwkin tih tak zetin ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lâwmman atân ro luah tûr Lalpa hnên aṭangin in hmu dâwn tih hre reng rawh u. Lalpa Krista rawng in bâwl a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thil dik lo titute chuan thil dik lo an tih man an hmu ang, Pathian chuan tu mah a thlei bîk si lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hotute u, nangni pawhin vânah Hotu in nei tih hriain, in bawihte chungah dik tak leh ṭha takin engkim ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ṭawngṭai fan fan ula, in ṭawngṭainaah lâwmthu hril chungin ngaihven rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keini pawh min ṭawngṭaisak rawh u, Pathianin a thu hrilna kawng min hawnsak nân te, ka lung in tân chhan, Krista thu ril puan hi ka chhunzawm theih nân te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ka sawi tûr ang taka ka sawi theih nân te mi ṭawngṭaisak bawk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ring lote lakah fing takin awm ula, in hun chu hmang ṭha rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eng lai pawhin ṭha tak leh hawihhâwm takin ṭawng ṭhîn ula; tichuan, mi tin engtia chhân tûr nge in hre thei dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpaa ka bawihpui, rawngbâwltu rinawm tak, kan unau duh tak Tukika hian ka chanchin zawng zawng a rawn hrilh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan chanchin in hriata, rilru hlim taka in awm theih nân ka rawn tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama rual hian nangmahni mi, unau duh tak Onesima, ringtu nghet tak hi ka rawn tîr ve a. Hêng lam chanchin hi an rawn hrilh vek ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan tânpui Aristarka hian chibai a bûk a che u. Marka, Barnaba tupa pawh hian chibai a bûk a che u (Ani hi in hnêna a lo kal hun chuan lo lâwm tûrin ka hrilh tawh che u kha).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Isua, Justa an tih hian chibai a bûk a che u. Juda Kristiante zîngah chuan anni pathum chauh hi Pathian ram tâna min thawhpuitu an ni a, min tithlamuang hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Epafra, nangmahni mi, Krista Isua bawih hian chibai a bûk a che u. A ṭawngṭai apiangin nghet taka in dina, in lo puitlina, Pathian duhzâwng anga ringtu tak in nih theih nân ṭhahnemngai takin a dîlsak ṭhîn che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangniho tân te, Laodikei khuaa mite leh Hierapolis khuaa mite tân ani hian a thawk nasa êm êm tih kei pawhin ka hria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Luka, daktor duh tak leh Dema hian chibai an bûk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Laodikei khuaa unau awmte leh Numfii leh a ina kohhran inkhâwm kha chibai min bûksak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka lehkha hi in zînga in chhiar zawhah Laodikei kohhran chhiartîr ve ula, chutiang bawkin Laodikei kohhran lehkha pawh kha lo chhiar ve ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Arkipa hnênah khân, “Rawngbâwl hna Lalpa hnên ata i dawn kha hlen tûrin fîmkhur rawh,” ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei Paulan hei hi keima kut ngeia chibai ka bûkna che u a nih hi, ka kawl bunte hi hre reng rawh u. Khawngaihna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
